    "While it's on, every copy joins the stack and each ⌘V pastes the next clip. It stops with this shortcut, from the menu bar, when the stack runs out, or when you pick a clip in Copyd. The first time, macOS asks you to allow Input Monitoring." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "While it's on, every copy joins the stack and each ⌘V pastes the next clip. It stops with this shortcut, from the menu bar, when the stack runs out, or when you pick a clip in Copyd. The first time, macOS asks you to allow Input Monitoring."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mientras está activo, cada copia se suma a la pila y cada ⌘V pega el siguiente clip. Se detiene con este atajo, desde la barra de menús, cuando la pila se vacía o cuando eliges un clip en Copyd. La primera vez, macOS te pide permitir la Monitorización de entrada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
